        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: 2-D, Damon Albarn, Nelson De Freitas\n- Bands/Projects: Blur, Gorillaz\n- Roles: singing voice, speaking voice, lead singer, co-founder, vocalist, instrumentalist, principal songwriter, actor\n- Media: Gorillaz recordings, performances, direct-to-video projects\n\nFacts:\n- Damon Albarn is the lead singer of the British rock band Blur.\n- Damon Albarn is the co-founder, vocalist, instrumentalist, and principal songwriter of the virtual band Gorillaz.\n- On Gorillaz recordings and performances, 2-D's singing voice is provided by Damon Albarn.\n- In various Gorillaz direct-to-video projects, 2-D's speaking voice is provided by actor Nelson De Freitas.",
